  {
   "copper": 13,
   "description": "Reed Jungle Lynxes keep prowling the Raincall Highwood, in the west of Raincall Basin, by day, and our gardeners have enough to wrestle with. Kill six for this repeatable bounty. You can take it again twenty minutes after turning it in; I suspect the cats will keep their side of that arrangement.",
