   "copper": 13,
   "description": "I patch our capes while the tithe collectors strut about in fresh linen. Bring me three Linen Cloth from the Bandit Lookouts at the Raincall Bandit Camp west from here. Neshi wants their bows quiet; I want something for all the stitching their thieving has cost us.",
